<figure>
        <div class="fig-frame">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 330" role="img" aria-label="Three agent boxes stacked vertically. Each is improved by the one above it. Above the top box is a question: who improves this one? The chain has no top.">
            <defs>
              <marker id="ar0" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6.5" markerHeight="6.5" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--ink-3)"/>
              </marker>
            </defs>
            <text class="fig-head" x="40" y="20">INFINITE REGRESS</text>

            <text class="fig-sub" x="40" y="52">who improves this one?</text>
            <path class="fig-dash" d="M108 60 L108 86"/>
            <text class="fig-sub" x="116" y="78">&hellip;</text>

            <rect class="fig-box" x="40" y="92" width="150" height="42" rx="2"/>
            <text class="fig-label" x="56" y="119">agent 3</text>
            <line class="fig-line" x1="108" y1="176" x2="108" y2="140" marker-end="url(#ar0)"/>
            <text class="fig-sub" x="120" y="162">improves</text>

            <rect class="fig-box" x="40" y="176" width="150" height="42" rx="2"/>
            <text class="fig-label" x="56" y="203">agent 2</text>
            <line class="fig-line" x1="108" y1="260" x2="108" y2="224" marker-end="url(#ar0)"/>
            <text class="fig-sub" x="120" y="246">improves</text>

            <rect class="fig-box" x="40" y="260" width="150" height="42" rx="2"/>
            <text class="fig-label" x="56" y="287">agent 1</text>

            <text class="fig-sub" x="230" y="119">each agent is one piece,</text>
            <text class="fig-sub" x="230" y="137">so it cannot revise itself</text>
            <text class="fig-sub" x="230" y="203">the fix has to come from</text>
            <text class="fig-sub" x="230" y="221">an agent above it</text>
            <text class="fig-sub" x="230" y="287">which is built the same way</text>

            <text class="fig-label" x="40" y="322">the chain has no top</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <figcaption><b>Figure 1.</b> The naive route to self-improvement. Every agent needs an improver above it, and the improver is built the same way, so the stack either never ends or ends at something nobody improves. <b>The problem is not any one agent; it is that the agent is the smallest thing there is.</b></figcaption>
      </figure>
